LEVEL4 {Fracture: weather & seasons}

 Turn the daily weather and season cycle on or off. When on, one
 weather condition affects the whole server each day (shown on
 entry, in status, and with the news), gathering yields rise and
 fall with it, and storms and snow make travel cost more Action
 Points.

WXOPT {Enable weather and seasons? YES} B

 How many days each season lasts before the world turns to the
 next. Seasons cycle Spring, Summer, Autumn, Winter and bias which
 weather each day is likely to bring.

SEASLEN {Days per season? 7} N 1 90

