LEVEL4 {Fracture: workers & production}

 Turn the crew system on or off. When on, players can house NPC
 workers at their camp (up to a limit set by the camp tier) who
 produce resources passively - one day's worth each new day the
 player logs in. The crew eats Food, and the day's weather scales
 what they produce.

WRKOPT {Enable workers and production? YES} B

 Base units of its resource each worker produces per day, before
 the day's weather is applied.

WRKPROD {Resource units produced per worker per day? 2} N 0 50

 Food each worker eats per day. If the camp cannot feed the whole
 crew, the hungry workers still produce but the shortfall is noted.

WRKFOOD {Food eaten per worker per day? 1} N 0 50

