 Base Fame earned for each unit of a resource sold, before the
 per-resource weight is applied.

MKTSELL {Fame earned per resource unit sold? 2} N 0 100

 Base Fame charged for each unit of a resource bought. Keep this at
 or above the sell rate so trading is not a free source of Fame.

